<title>AUSTRIA: VA Tech sells 1.5% stake in VA Stahl.</title>
<headline>VA Tech sells 1.5% stake in VA Stahl.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian engineering group VA Technologie AG said on Wednesday it had sold a 1.51 percent stake in steel maker VA Stahl.</p>
<p>The sale reduces VA Tech's investment in VA Stahl to 21.22 percent from 22.73, VA Tech said in a brief statement. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12 254</p>
